{"height": 20, "weight": 1505, "base_experience": 270, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-defense", "value": 3}], "genus": "Dragon Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 35, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["dragon"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ヌメルゴン"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Numelgon"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "미끄래곤"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "黏美龍"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Muplodocus"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Viscogon"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Goodra"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Goodra"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ヌメルゴン"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "黏美龙"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Goodra"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "This very friendly Dragon-type Pokémon will hug its beloved Trainer, leaving that Trainer covered in sticky slime."}, {"versions": ["y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It attacks with retractable horns. It throws a punch that’s the equivalent of the force of a hundred pro boxers."}, {"versions": ["sun"], "text": "An amazingly friendly Pokémon, but if left to itself, loneliness overcomes it, and it oozes gooey tears."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "It gets picked on because it’s meek. But then, whoever teased it gets to feel the full force of its horns and a good swatting from its thick tail."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It’s very friendly toward people. If you grow close to it, Goodra will hug you with its sticky, slime-covered body. Don’t get mad."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Underneath its slimy skin is a thick layer of fat, and the combination of the two makes enemies’ attacks slide right off."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "Sometimes it misunderstands instructions and appears dazed or bewildered. Many Trainers don’t mind, finding this behavior to be adorable."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Its form of offense is forcefully stretching out its horns. The strikes lan